#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php
msgid "Barrio Suite WPGraphQL"
msgstr "Barrio Suite WPGraphQL"

#. Description of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php
msgid ""
"The Barrio Suite forms and SEO in WPGraphQL, with the names of the previous "
"plugin (hbForm, hbSubmitForm, seo, hbSeoSite, hbSitemap…), so headless "
"frontends keep working unchanged."
msgstr ""
"I form e il SEO di Barrio Suite in WPGraphQL, con i nomi del plugin "
"precedente (hbForm, hbSubmitForm, seo, hbSeoSite, hbSitemap…), così i "
"frontend headless continuano a funzionare senza modifiche."

#. Author of the plugin
#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php
msgid "Hellobarrio"
msgstr "Hellobarrio"

#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php:68
msgid "Frontend address"
msgstr "Indirizzo del frontend"

#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php:69
msgid ""
"The address of the headless site, like https://www.example.com. In GraphQL "
"the links of the Barrio Suite SEO (canonical, JSON-LD, llms.txt) point there "
"instead of WordPress; images stay on WordPress."
msgstr ""
"L'indirizzo del sito headless, come https://www.esempio.it. In GraphQL i "
"link del SEO di Barrio Suite (canonical, JSON-LD, llms.txt) puntano lì invece "
"che a WordPress; le immagini restano su WordPress."

#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php:352
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to list the forms."
msgstr "Non hai i permessi per elencare i form."

#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php:379
msgid "Form not found."
msgstr "Form non trovato."

#: barrio-suite-wpgraphql.php:436
msgid "Thank you, your submission has been received."
msgstr "Grazie, abbiamo ricevuto il tuo messaggio."
